# What Scala Native 0.5.12's build makes of each jar (refused, none or the files it unpacks under scala-native/), written
# by tests/native-build/jar-names-oracle.scala (which says how to run it again) under:
# Scala Native 0.5.12's tools for Scala 3, Java 24.0.2 Eclipse Adoptium
# The jars marked `tool` were written by real tools (tests/native-build/tool-jars.py); each one's tool, version and command:
#   tool-jar-create | jar 24.0.2 | jar cf <jar> -C <files> .
#   tool-jar-stored | jar 24.0.2 | jar cf0 <jar> -C <files> .
#   tool-jar-many | jar 24.0.2 | jar cf <jar> -C <files> .
#   tool-jar-manifest | jar 24.0.2 | jar cfm <jar> <manifest> -C <files> .
#   tool-jar-update | jar 24.0.2 | jar cf <jar> -C <files without inc/> . then jar uf <jar> -C <inc/> .
#   tool-jar-date | jar 24.0.2 | jar --create --date=2001-01-01T00:00:00Z --file <jar> -C <files> .
#   tool-jar-nomanifest | jar 24.0.2 | jar cfM <jar> -C <files> .
#   tool-jar-update-twice | jar 24.0.2 | jar cf <jar> -C <files> . then jar uf <jar> twice (a C file replaced twice, one added)
#   tool-jar-release | jar 24.0.2 | jar --create --file <jar> -C <files> . --release 11 -C <v11> . (META-INF/versions/11/scala-native/jar_release.c)
#   tool-jar-index | jar 24.0.2 | jar cf <jar> -C <files> . then jar -i <jar>
#   tool-zos-stored | openjdk version "24.0.2" 2025-07-15 OpenJDK Runtime Environment Temurin-24.0.2+12 (build 24.0.2+12) OpenJDK 64-Bit Serve | java tests/native-build/ZipWriter.java <jar> <files> stored
#   tool-zos-deflated | openjdk version "24.0.2" 2025-07-15 OpenJDK Runtime Environment Temurin-24.0.2+12 (build 24.0.2+12) OpenJDK 64-Bit Serve | java tests/native-build/ZipWriter.java <jar> <files> deflated
#   tool-zos-deflated-1 | openjdk version "24.0.2" 2025-07-15 OpenJDK Runtime Environment Temurin-24.0.2+12 (build 24.0.2+12) OpenJDK 64-Bit Serve | java tests/native-build/ZipWriter.java <jar> <files> deflated-1
#   tool-zos-deflated-9 | openjdk version "24.0.2" 2025-07-15 OpenJDK Runtime Environment Temurin-24.0.2+12 (build 24.0.2+12) OpenJDK 64-Bit Serve | java tests/native-build/ZipWriter.java <jar> <files> deflated-9
#   tool-zos-commented | openjdk version "24.0.2" 2025-07-15 OpenJDK Runtime Environment Temurin-24.0.2+12 (build 24.0.2+12) OpenJDK 64-Bit Serve | java tests/native-build/ZipWriter.java <jar> <files> commented
#   tool-zos-directories | openjdk version "24.0.2" 2025-07-15 OpenJDK Runtime Environment Temurin-24.0.2+12 (build 24.0.2+12) OpenJDK 64-Bit Serve | java tests/native-build/ZipWriter.java <jar> <files> directories
#   tool-zos-jar | openjdk version "24.0.2" 2025-07-15 OpenJDK Runtime Environment Temurin-24.0.2+12 (build 24.0.2+12) OpenJDK 64-Bit Serve | java tests/native-build/ZipWriter.java <jar> <files> jar
#   tool-zip-0 | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r -0 <jar> . (in <files>)
#   tool-zip-1 | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r -1 <jar> . (in <files>)
#   tool-zip-6 | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r -6 <jar> . (in <files>)
#   tool-zip-9 | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r -9 <jar> . (in <files>)
#   tool-zip-X | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r -X <jar> . (in <files>)
#   tool-zip-D | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r -D <jar> . (in <files>)
#   tool-zip-fz | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r -fz <jar> . (in <files>)
#   tool-zip-many | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r <jar> . (in <files>)
#   tool-zip-comment | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r -z <jar> . (the comment on stdin)
#   tool-zip-stream | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r - . | cat > <jar> (streamed: data descriptors)
#   tool-zip-sfx | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | a shell stub, then the zip of <files>, then zip -A <jar> (the offsets adjusted)
#   tool-zip-links-followed | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r <jar> . (a link to a header and one to a directory)
#   tool-zip-links-kept | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r -y <jar> . (a link to a header and one to a directory)
#   tool-zip-bzip2 | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r -Z bzip2 <jar> .
#   tool-zip-split-joined | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r -s 64k <part.zip> . (200 kB of random bytes among the files) then zip -q -s 0 <part.zip> --out <joined.zip>
#   tool-zip-split-last | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | zip -q -r -s 64k <part.zip> . (200 kB of random bytes among the files): its last part alone
#   tool-zip-latin1 | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | LC_ALL=C zip -q -r <jar> . (a file named in Latin-1)
#   tool-zip-utf8-c-locale | This is Zip 3.0 (July 5th 2008), by Info-ZIP. | LC_ALL=C zip -q -r <jar> . (the UTF-8 names under the C locale)
#   tool-python-stored | Python 3.14.4 zipfile | zipfile.ZipFile(<jar>, 'w', ZIP_STORED)
#   tool-python-deflated | Python 3.14.4 zipfile | zipfile.ZipFile(<jar>, 'w', ZIP_DEFLATED)
#   tool-python-force-zip64 | Python 3.14.4 zipfile | zipfile.ZipFile(<jar>, 'w', ZIP_DEFLATED), force_zip64 on each entry
#   tool-python-commented | Python 3.14.4 zipfile | zipfile.ZipFile(<jar>, 'w', ZIP_DEFLATED), a comment
#   tool-python-many | Python 3.14.4 zipfile | zipfile.ZipFile(<jar>, 'w', ZIP_DEFLATED)
#   tool-python-append | jar 24.0.2, then Python 3.14.4 zipfile | jar cf <jar> -C <files> . then zipfile.ZipFile(<jar>, 'a') adds a C file
#   tool-python-pastdate | Python 3.14.4 zipfile | zipfile ZipInfo entries dated 1980-01-01 and a directory entry
#   tool-python-bzip2 | Python 3.14.4 zipfile | zipfile.ZipFile(<jar>, 'w', ZIP_BZIP2)
#   tool-python-lzma | Python 3.14.4 zipfile | zipfile.ZipFile(<jar>, 'w', ZIP_LZMA)
