#   tool-7z-store | 7-Zip 25.01 (x64) | 7z a -tzip -mx=0 <jar> . (in <files>)
#   tool-7z-deflate64 | 7-Zip 25.01 (x64) | 7z a -tzip -mm=Deflate64 <jar> . (in <files>)
#   tool-7z-utf8 | 7-Zip 25.01 (x64) | 7z a -tzip -mcu=on <jar> . (in <files>)
#   tool-7z-passes | 7-Zip 25.01 (x64) | 7z a -tzip -mx=9 -mpass=15 <jar> . (in <files>)
